' Shared diagram theme of the site. Colours are the standard C4-PlantUML ones, as on the
' landing page; external systems are darker than the standard grey so white text reads well.
' Included after the C4 stdlib include: !include styles.iuml (from the src root),
' !include ../styles.iuml (from a page folder).

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundCorner 10

UpdateElementStyle("external_system", $bgColor="#5c6977", $borderColor="#46535f")
